@startuml j3-booking-and-call-back
!include style.iuml
title J3 Booking request and call-back
actor Patient
participant "Chat page /" as Chat
participant "POST /api/chat" as Api
participant "matcher.ts\n(detectBooking)" as M
participant "booking-time.ts" as B
database "Shared store" as Store
participant "Staff page /staff" as SP
actor Staff
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : "Can I book a cleaning tomorrow at 5 pm?"
Chat -> Api : POST {chatId, message}
Api -> M : through answerPatient, after the guards: detectBooking(message, clinic)
M --> Api : day, time and the booking reply
note right of M : code makes the ticket; the AI step is not asked
Api -> B : requestedLabel(day, time)
B --> Api : "requested tomorrow, <calendar date in India>, 5:00 pm"
Api -> Store : insertTicket(needs human, P2, question + label)
Api -> Store : insertMessage(assistant)
Api --> Chat : reply: the clinic will call back to confirm
Chat --> Patient : the booking reply

Staff -> SP : opens /staff
SP -> Store : GET /api/tickets
SP --> Staff : "To call back" list and the ticket with day, date and time
Staff -> SP : calls the patient, then replies on the ticket or presses Close
SP -> Store : POST /api/tickets {ticketId, reply} or {ticketId, close: true}
@enduml
